pari mutuel. See FRENCH WORDS. pari passu. Pronounce pari pi’si. parisyllabic. See TECHNICAL TERMS. parlance. See JARGON. parley. Pl. of noun, -eys. For verb inflexion, see VERBS IN -IE Pa 2, parliament. Pronounce par’lament. parlo(u)r. Keep the u; but see -OUR & -OR. parlous is a word that wise men leave alone. It is the same by
===
**pari mutuel.** See ^^FRENCH WORDS^^.

**pari passu.** Pronounce pār'ī pă'sū.

**parisyllabic.** See ^^TECHNICAL TERMS^^.

**parlance.** See ^^JARGON^^.

**parley.** Pl. of noun, *-eys*. For verb inflexion, see ^^VERBS IN -IE^^ &c., 2.

**parliament.** Pronounce par'lament.

**parlo(u)r.** Keep the u; but see ^^-OUR^^ & ^^-OR^^.

**parlous** is a word that wise men leave alone. It is the same by
