<<<
+ origin as perilous; but it had centuries ago the same fate that has befallen awful & chronic within living memory; it became a VoGuE- WORD applied to many things very remote from its proper sense; it consequently lost all significance,
===
+ origin as *perilous*; but it had centuries ago the same fate that has befallen *awful* & *chronic* within living memory; it became a ^^VOGUE-WORD^^ applied to many things very remote from its proper sense; it consequently lost all significance,
